General_SiSo_Auto_Initiate_RF_Diagnostic_test_from_WebEM
    [Documentation]
    ...  Verifies Rf diagnostic procedure using selenium, during L3call data transfer on NR/LTE cell
    ...  The procedure can be found via WEBEM: Diagnostic -> RF Diagnostic Test -> RF Diagnostic Test Result
    ...  (Additionally Test Setup tab).
    ...  Main steps of the test case look like:
    ...    1) starting L3 call in background
    ...    2) configuring RF diagnostic test for provided cell's id
    ...    3) starting RF diagnostic test
    ...    4) getting WEBEM RF diagnostic test general result and detailed result
    ...    5) getting RFRES object RF diagnostic test result
    ...    6) validating RF diagnostic test general result:
    ...       - status should be equal to "success"
    ...       - output should be equal to "Pass"
    ...       - time should be in UTC Format
    ...    7) validating RF diagnostic test detailed result:
    ...       - result should contain all mandatory parameters
    ...       - results should be numeric or equal to "-"
    ...    8) repeating 6) and 7) validation's steps for RFRES object RF diagnostic test result
    ...    9) clearing RF diagnostic test results
    ...    10) configuring RF diagnostic test for all cells of provided technology
    ...    11) starting RF diagnostic test
    ...    12) repeating 4) - 8) steps for each cell of provided type
    ...    13) verifying background L3 call results
    ...    14) clearing RF diagnostic test results
    ...
    ...    ARGS:
    ...      - cell_id (int): global cell id of NR/LTE cell to perform rf diagnostic test, e.g.: 1
    ...      - throughputs (dict): dict with throughput and deviation values for each cell; defaults to None.
    ...        Example:
    ...                 {'827736065': {'throughput': {'downlink': '100 Mbits/sec',
    ...                                               'uplink': '15 Mbits/sec'},
    ...                                'deviation': '90%'},
    ...                  }
    ...      - cell_type (str): type of cell, nr/lte; defaults to 'nr'.
    ...      - custom_cell_name (str): cell name for RF diagnostic test, should be set if cell name differs from
    ...        standard cell name: NRCELL-0 or LNCEL-20; defaults to None.
    ...      - l3_call_duration (int): duration (in seconds) of L3 call data transfer (>=240s); defaults to 240.
    ...        Note that 240 seconds is the minimum for KW to work properly.
    ...      - protocol (str): data transfer protocol; defaults to 'udp'.
    ...      - udp_buffer (str): monitoring data buffer; defaults to '4M'.
    ...      - ignored_cells_on_preparation (list[str]): SHOULD BE USED WITH `prepare_cells_to_call` set to True!
    ...                                                  list of cells CONFIGURATION distnames that should be ignored during
    ...                                                  L3 Call not called cells preparation procedure and not be blocked/barred

    [Arguments]                                             ${cell_id}
    ...                                                     ${throughputs}=${None}
    ...                                                     ${cell_type}=nr
    ...                                                     ${custom_cell_name}=${None}
    ...                                                     ${l3_call_duration}=240
    ...                                                     ${protocol}=udp
    ...                                                     ${udp_buffer}=4M
    ...                                                     ${ignored_cells_on_preparation}=${None}
    [Timeout]                                               24 hours

